const fontOptions=selected=>[['system','มาตรฐาน'],['sans','Sans'],['serif','Serif'],['mono','Mono']].map(([value,label])=>`<option value="${value}"${selected===value?' selected':''}>${label}</option>`).join('');
const styleFields=item=>`<div class="vpage-field-pair"><label>แบบอักษร<select name="text_font">${fontOptions(item.text_font||'system')}</select></label><label>สีข้อความ<input name="text_color" type="color" value="${esc(item.text_color||'#073b38')}"></label></div>`;
